ally start  heading towards koala's home island  arlong does stir the pot a little bit  asking koala if her parents taught her  to look down on fish men then going on  on his typical  racial superiority and humans are evil  speech however jinbe cuts in to correct  him saying that yes  some humans are hateful but others who  look at them like koala does aren't  filled with hate they're just filled  with fear he begins to question what  they might be so afraid of and koala  explains that they're only afraid  because they don't know anything about  fishman this putting jinbe in a spot to  wonder if otohime's message really is  the right path and learning more about  one another could actually lead to peace  weeks later and it's time to drop koala  off and even macro who was so  cold-hearted that he sold other fish men  into slavery is crying because he's  going to miss her so much fisher says  that he'll take koala to her village  personally and koala promises to tell  everyone about how nice fish men are  again jinbe and arlong kind of quickly  cross their moral swords as arlong says  she'll grow up to be just like the rest  of humanity and saying that jinbe has  changed if he thinks otherwise and  things are great as koala reaches home  but this is a one piece backstory so  things need to go to hell as tiger walks  back to his ship he's ambushed by rear  admiral strawberry and a small army of  marines they were apparently tipped off  by the people of koala's village meaning  the tiger had gone out of his way to  help this girl and even rescued her from  slavery  only for her people to betray him at the  same time the sun pirates ship was also  being attacked and sunk but luckily all  the fishman managed to escape they steal  a marine ship  but tiger was already mortally wounded  tiger apparently had a rare blood type  but by taking a human blood transfusion  he could be saved  however he forbids it screaming saying  that he doesn't want to live with their  blood in h